# requirements.in - the packages Cruddur chooses on purpose (unpinned intent).
# NOT installed by any Dockerfile. requirements.txt is the lock that is
# installed. To change a dependency: edit this file, rebuild in a scratch
# environment, regenerate requirements.txt from `pip freeze`, and prove the
# change with a freeze diff (Release F).

